title: "Discard this change" of the card's menu on the removed step_6 (the 1->2 replacement above stays): step_6 must come back between step_5 and step_7 with one empty line on each side
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n\}\n[\s\S]*fn step_5\(\) -> u32 \{\n    5\n\}\n\nfn step_6\(\) -> u32 \{\n    6\n\}\n\nfn step_7\(\) -> u32 \{\n    7\n[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1200
menu 1000 622
wait 500
mark menu
wait 600
ui click 1100 532
wait 500
mark asked
wait 600
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
